  "body": "For now, this spec only refers to a Storage Buckets in non-normative text. For example, there's text like this:\r\n\r\n> |locator|'s [=file system locator/root=] might include relevant identifying information such as the [=storage bucket=]\r\n\r\nOnce Storage Buckets becomes standardized, we can make it explicit that a `file system locator` knows about its storage bucket if it's in an Origin Private File System (or whatever we decide to call it #92), which would be a much cleaner solution to #103",
